[02:11.59]And there's another country
[02:18.31]I've heard of long ago
[02:25.36]Most dear to them that love her
[02:32.43]Most great to them that know
[02:39.77]We may not count her armies
[02:46.95]We may not see her King
[02:54.22]Her fortress is a faithful heart
[03:01.55]Her pride is suffering
[03:12.35]And soul by soul and silently
[03:19.27]Her shining bounds increase
[03:26.89]And her ways are ways of gentleness
[03:33.64]And all her paths are peace
[03:46.95]感谢AssCream2001同学提供的歌词
